  designNotes: "Beat 12: finale. Combines beat 6's boss phase with beat 4's charge,
    on beat 5's biome \u2014 three things the player already knows, arriving together.
    The wide fortress tier is the largest structure in the game (6.0 wide, 250 hp)
    and its fall is the loudest moment the campaign has; the Sovereign and a shield
    escort walk out of the rubble, so the last volley of the arc is fired at something
    that was not on the field when it started."
